        </div>
        <h3>Ads &amp; UGC</h3>
        <p>Performance creatives built to convert — hook-first structure, motion graphics and platform-ready exports.</p>
        <div class="tags"><span class="tag">Paid Ads</span><span class="tag">UGC</span><span class="tag">A/B Cuts</span></div>
      </article>

      <!-- 5. Brands -->
      <article class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2.5 14.4 8.2 20.5 9l-4.6 4.2 1.3 6L12 16.4 6.8 19.2l1.3-6L3.5 9l6.1-.8z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Brands</h3>
        <p>Brand films, product launches, corporate storytelling and social campaigns with a consistent visual identity.</p>
        <div class="tags"><span class="tag">Brand Film</span><span class="tag">Launch</span><span class="tag">Social</span></div>
      </article>

      <!-- 6. AI Videos -->
      <article class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="7.5" y="7.5" width="9" height="9" rx="2"/><path d="M12 2.5v3M12 18.5v3M2.5 12h3M18.5 12h3M5.2 5.2l2.1 2.1M16.7 16.7l2.1 2.1M18.8 5.2l-2.1 2.1M7.3 16.7l-2.1 2.1"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>AI Videos</h3>
        <p>AI-generated visuals, avatar presenters, voice cloning and faceless content — polished into a real narrative.</p>
